  "originalOptions": "A. Use Cloud Spanner for the managed database service and Google Cloud Functions for the bare metal infrastructure.<br/>B. Use Cloud Bigtable for the managed database service and Google Kubernetes Engine with node pools of bare-metal machines for the bare metal infrastructure.<br/>C. Use Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL for the managed database service and Google Compute Engine with sole-tenant nodes for the bare metal infrastructure.<br/>D. Use Cloud Spanner for the managed database service and Bare Metal Solution for the bare metal infrastructure.",
